implemented for U1Circuit. Please use expectation_ps instead.\"\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:537:    def expectation_ps(  # type: ignore\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:546:        Compute expectation value of a Pauli string.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:581:        # But here we just want to compute the expectation in the U(1) sector.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:582:        # If the Pauli string moves the state out of the sector, the expectation is 0.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:585:        # For U(1) sector, expectation is 0 if total bit flips is odd\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:1044:    def expectation_pss(\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:1050:        Compute the expectation value of a sum of Pauli strings in the U(1) subspace.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:1058:        :return: The expectation value of the sum of Pauli strings.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:1113:            def term_expectation(target_idx: Tensor, phase_fact: Tensor) -> Tensor:\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/u1circuit.py:1119:            vmapped_expect = backend.vmap(term_expectation, vectorized_argnums=(0, 1))\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/mps_base.py:193:        Measure the expectation value of local operators `ops` site `sites`.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:124:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:131:    Discrete Fourier transform (Hadamard-like) on ``d`` levels.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:142:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:161:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:318:    phase = backend.exp(1j * theta)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:345:    Acts like a qubit :math:`RZZ(\\theta)=\\exp(-i\\,\\tfrac{\\theta}{2}\\,\\sigma_z)` on the\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:370:    phase_minus = backend.exp(-1j * theta / 2.0)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:371:    phase_plus = backend.exp(+1j * theta / 2.0)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:475:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:488:        zeta = np.exp(2j * np.pi / 9)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:512:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditgates.py:553:    omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / d) if omega is None else omega\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:303:    # Calculate exp(-i*projected_H*t) * projected_state\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:306:        # Calculate exp(-i*eigenvalues*t)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:307:        exp_diagonal = backend.exp(-1j * eigenvalues * t)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:309:        # Evolve state in eigenbasis: |psi_evolved_coeff> = exp(-i*D*t) |psi_coeff>\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:393:        ebetah_utpsi0 = backend.exp(-t * es) * utpsi0\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/timeevol.py:824:    phase = backend.exp(-1j * b * t)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:87:        self._omega = np.exp(2j * np.pi / self._d)\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:206:        Apply the generalized Hadamard-like gate `H` (DFT on `d` levels) on the given qudit.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:417:    def expectation(\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:426:        Compute expectation(s) of local operators.\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:430:        :param reuse: If True, then the wavefunction tensor is cached for further expectation evaluation,\n/usr/local/lib/python3.11/site-packages/tensorcircuit/quditcircuit.py:441:        return self._circ.expectation(\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
